    "query":"Artificial Intelligence is gradually transforming the education system by making learning more personalized and accessible. Traditional classrooms generally follow a fixed teaching approach, where every student receives the same material regardless of their learning speed or understanding. However, AI-powered platforms can analyze a student'\''s performance, identify weak areas, and recommend learning materials based on individual needs.

